        "sid": "ISA 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who go to Egypt for help are doomed! They are relying on Egypt's vast military strength — horses, chariots, and soldiers. But they do not rely on the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the holy God of Israel, or ask him for help. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He knows what he is doing! He sends disaster. He carries out his threats to punish evil men and those who protect them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Egyptians are not gods — they are only human. Their horses are not supernatural. When the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " acts, the strong nation will crumble, and the weak nation it helped will fall. Both of them will be destroyed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, “No matter how shepherds yell and shout, they can't scare away a lion from an animal that it has killed; in the same way, there is nothing that can keep me, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty, from protecting Mount Zion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Just as a bird hovers over its nest to protect its young, so I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty, will protect Jerusalem and defend it.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “People of Israel, you have sinned against me and opposed me. But now, come back to me! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A time is coming when all of you will throw away the sinful idols you made out of silver and gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Assyria will be destroyed in war, but not by human power. The Assyrians will run from battle, and their young men will be made slaves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their emperor will run away in terror, and the officers will be so frightened that they will abandon their battle flags.” The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken — the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " who is worshipped in Jerusalem and whose fire burns there for sacrifices.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
